WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:01.320
Our army's

00:01.400 --> 00:02.800
How is morale?

00:10.240 --> 00:11.040
This time the Wutu

00:11.120 --> 00:12.360
Have mobilized fifty thousand

00:12.440 --> 00:13.480
While we

00:13.560 --> 00:14.960
Only have five thousand

00:15.400 --> 00:16.320
In this situation

00:16.400 --> 00:17.680
The few hundred elite cavalry who've followed me

00:17.760 --> 00:19.200
May fight to the death

00:19.280 --> 00:20.680
But the other soldiers

00:21.160 --> 00:22.560
May waver

00:22.640 --> 00:23.840
However

00:23.920 --> 00:24.680
Yiyang City

00:24.760 --> 00:26.080
Has strong and complete walls

00:26.160 --> 00:27.480
And with Your Highness here

00:27.560 --> 00:28.960
All are united

00:29.040 --> 00:29.840
At least

00:29.920 --> 00:31.587
Can hold for five days

00:32.280 --> 00:33.920
Before the enemy's full assault

00:34.560 --> 00:36.200
If there's no major defeat

00:36.280 --> 00:38.120
Should be able to hold for seven days

